\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  Intl Reserves -3: Drop Linked To  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 226 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Februar 1999\par 22:12\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Later Wednesday, a source at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  press office said that the $19 million drop in Tuesday's international reserves figure was a result of the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  It was not clear, however, that $19 million was the total used by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Tuesday as details of other flows influencing reserves were not released. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced Tuesday that it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for the first time since the adoption of a free-float on Jan. 18. The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  again on Wednesday \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in morning trade, selling dollars in order to strengthen the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The source also said that the IMF knew in advance of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's plans to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Tuesday and Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The government and the IMF are currently reviewing the terms of the $41.5 billion credit line and are expected to announce a new macroeconomic framework in the next few days, possibly including rules for \b \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The source added, however, that the recent \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  didn't\par indicate the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's future \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  policy.\par    -By Kieran Gartlan; (5511) 813-1988; kgartlan@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 24-02-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2112GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2o01ipn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
