iday," said a Rio de Janeiro \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer, citing the futures settlements and other potential market-moving news. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) DOW JONES NEWS  02-24-99 \par \par \uc2  03:48 PM \par \par \uc2 Dokument dj00000020010827dv2o04uhe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
