\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  Real Ends -2: Session Marked By Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 250 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Februar 1999\par 21:48\par \uc2  Dow Jones Commodities Service \par \uc2 DJCS\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--The Brazilian real (BRR) ended weaker against the dollar in volatile trade Wednesday, which saw official \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and real-dollar rates at over the psychological BRR2.00/dollar mark for most of the session. \par \par \uc2  The real ended at a mid-rate of BRR2.04/dlr on a spread of BRR2.03-2.05/dlr, compared to Tuesday's finishing BRR2.01/dlr on a similarly narrow spread. The real opened Wednesday at BRR1.99/dlr. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman told Dow Jones Newswires at the close of trade Wednesday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to contain sharp fluctuations, but couldn't say exactly how many times. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  acted more than once, but we don't have exact numbers," the spokesman said. This follows the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's first official \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in local \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets Tuesday since the real was finally allowed to float freely against the dollar on January 18. \par \par \uc2  Market participants said trading was volatile Wednesday, and more liquid than Tuesday - dealers reported $890 million registered in interbank trading by 2030 GMT - owing to the expiration of March dollar futures contracts Friday. \par \par \uc2  "Trading was more nervous in the morning, but will be nothing compared to what we're expecting Friday," said a Rio de Janeiro \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer, citing the futures settlements and other potential market-moving news. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 24-02-99 \par \par \uc2  2048GMT \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument djcs000020010827dv2o00gny\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
