\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS- \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  cenbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  market. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Shasta Darlington \par \uc2 548 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Februar 1999\par 00:21\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO, Feb 23 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  selling dollars on Tuesday for the first time since the real was floated last month in a bid to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's downward tilt from spinning out of control, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The bank sold an unknown amount of dollars - estimated at up to $50 million by the market - to specific dealers in order to rein in the real after it sank 5 percent to 2.07 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  "We have the flexibility to, when we deem necessary, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market," the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  press office quoted interim president Demosthenes Madureira de Pinho Neto as saying. \par \par \uc2  "That is the policy, occasional \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  when we deem it adequate," he said, though he warned that there will not be specific levels at which the bank will sell dollars. \par \par \uc2  Global financial turmoil sparked huge capital flight in Brazil in 1998, eventually forcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to let the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  float freely against the dollar last month. The real, once the foundation of Brazil's economic stabilisation plan, has slid 40 percent since Jan. 13. \par \par \uc2  Even after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real closed 2 percent weaker at 2.01 per dollar on Tuesday on concern over dollar outflows, breaking the 2-to-1 psychological barrier for only the second time since the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's devastating devaluation began. \par \par \uc2  "The market was very nervous, pushing the rate up too high," a \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at Banco Bozano, Simonsen said. "The bank surprised the market with a discreet \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly through the trading tables." \par \par \uc2  Dollars continue to flow out of the country to pay off the roughly $3.8 billion in corporate bonds maturing in February and March, while sorely-needed export income has failed so far to offset the capital flight, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The deepening devaluation has forced Brazil to raise interest rates to ward off inflation and has thrown the economy into an even deeper recession. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday does not necessarily reflect a new policy, however, even though the real is expected to come under further pressure this week. \par \par \uc2  "The bank wants to be unpredictable," a trader at a local brokerage said. "Tomorrow the real could go to 2.1 and the bank might not do anything." \par \par \uc2  With \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures expiring at the end of the week and banks adjusting their dollar positions to comply with bank regulations by the end of the month, the real could continue its tumble. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not expected to adopt a more formal \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy until after Arminio Fraga, who was handpicked by President Fernando Henrique Cardoso to head the institution, is approved by the Senate. \par \par \uc2  "I wasn't expecting them to do anything before Arminio was confirmed at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," a trader at a local brokerage said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressures should subside if Fraga is confirmed and if the newly-installed Congress shows support for Cardoso's austerity plan, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Such moves would also pave the way for the next instalment of a $41.5 billion rescue loan put together by the International Monetary Fund, which would bolster reserves and investor confidence. \par \par \uc2  ((Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5408, shasta.darlington@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv2n0405u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
