\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's/Interbank Rate -2: Had  \highlight22\uc2 Intervened \highlight\uc2  At 38.8% Monday \b0\par\par\uc2 212 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Februar 1999\par 13:58\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the overnight market to set its interbank rate at 39%, a bank spokesman said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  daily to set rates on the interbank market since Jan. 19, one day after it raised the ceiling rate at which it may lend to banks to 41% from 36%. The interbank rate had been at 29.80% Jan. 18. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  three times Monday, borrowing at 39%, 38.9% and 38.8%, respectively, to dry up market liquidity owing to the settlement of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bonds, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday was also an indication that the market is calm and willing to accept lower rates. The interbank rate had remained unchanged at 39% since Feb. 1. \par \par \uc2  The government has said that it will use monetary policy to contain the inflationary pressure that has resulted from the sharp depreciation of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the past month. The real has lost more than 35% of its value against the dollar since Jan. 13, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  first loosened restrictions on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate movements. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 23-02-99 \par \par \uc2  1258GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2n01ees\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
