\par\par \b \uc2  Brazil Malan/Fraga -5: Amid IMF Meetings In Brasilia \b0\par\par\uc2 224 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Februar 1999\par 16:24\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Malan noted that the International Monetary Fund, which headed up a group of international lenders that granted Brazil a $41.5 aid package last year, didn't have any role in the decision to shake the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "There was not any type of consultation or suggestion" by the IMF or any other multi-lateral body, the finance minister said, noting that foreign input would have been "unacceptable interference" in an internal decision by a sovereign country. \par \par \uc2  "I assure to you that (the international lenders) learned about the decision, if they did already, by real time news reports," Malan noted. \par \par \uc2  IMF Deputy Managing Director Stanley Fischer is in Brazil, along with a team of economists, to review the terms of the aid deal. \par \par \uc2  The IMF team is expected to meet Tuesday and Wednesday with Malan to discuss rules for \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \par \par \uc2  When the government allowed the real to float Jan. 18, it said it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to contain "brusque movements" on the exchange market. As yet, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't officially \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also expected to negotiate the possible early release of a second tranche of international credit. It received a first tranche of $9.4 billion in December. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 02-02-99 \par \par \uc2  1524GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2200wc1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
