\par\par \b \uc2  IMF's Fischer Arrives In Brazil Around 1400 GMT Mon -Estado \b0\par\par\uc2 235 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Februar 1999\par 13:41\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO (Dow Jones)--International Monetary Fund First Deputy Managing Director Stanley Fischer will arrive in Brasilia Monday around 1400 GMT for meetings with Brazilian officials to review the terms of a $41.5 billion aid package finalized last year, the Estado news agency reported Monday. \par \par \uc2  An IMF delegation met Sunday with Brazilian officials to discuss macroeconomic issues. The two sides were meeting again early Monday, ahead of Fischer's arrival. \par \par \uc2  Finance Ministry executive secretary Pedro Parente said Sunday that Fischer's arrival should help expedite the release of a second tranche from international lenders. Brazil received a first allotment of $9.4 billion last December. \par \par \uc2  Fischer is expected to meet Tuesday and Wednesday with Finance Minister Pedro Malan. Last week, Malan said that \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2  would discuss rules for the government to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real, has lost about 40% of its value against the dollar since the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  loosed restrictions on exchange rate fluctuations on Jan. 13. \par \par \uc2  Speaking Sunday at the World Economic Forum in Davos, Switzerland, Fischer said that the real has depreciated far beyond where it should, but said the country still needs a credible monetary policy. \par \par \uc2  He noted that "the IMF will continue to work with Brazil to get it out of the crisis." \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 01-02-99 \par \par \uc2  1241GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2100rwb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
