\par\par \b \uc2  Bradys End Up On Alleged  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Januar 1999\par 22:30\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  NEW YORK (Dow Jones)--Brady bonds have stretched their early gains, ending sharply stronger Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Market participants attributed the strength of today's rally to widespread \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Brazilian government to support local markets. \par \par \uc2  Specifically, traders cited unconfirmed market speculation that the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had bought back as much as $100 million in Capitalization bonds to support the country's debt. \par \par \uc2  Some $8.7 billion in C-bonds are outstanding. \par \par \uc2  Brazil's C-bonds surged 2 5/8 to 52 5/8 bid, while Eligible Interest bonds jumped 3 1/4 to 57 7/8 bid. \par \par \uc2  "All day long, it has been rumored that Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been buying back C-bonds," a trader said. \par \par \uc2  The alleged government move fueled the rally in emerging debt as many banks and investors were seen diving into the market to cover their short positions. \par \par \uc2  Some market participants speculated that the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  may not have been limited to foreign debt, and also included the stock and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. The Bovespa stock index ended 6.3% higher, while the real closed slightly weaker at BRR1.82 against BRR1.79 at Monday's close. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, Argentine Pars rose 3/4 to 66 bid, while the Floating-Rate Bonds gained 1 7/8 to 78 1/8 bid. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The yield spread of the Emerging Markets Bond Index, or EMBI, had\par tightened about 65 basis points to 1380 basis points over comparable\par U.S. Treasurys.\par -By Enza Tedesco; 201-9382203;\par enza.tedesco@cor.dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  26-01-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2130GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1179 1810 4071 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010827dv1q000uu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
