\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  Real -2: Mkt Testing Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Price \b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Januar 1999\par 13:01\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--The Brazilian real (BRR) opened steady against the dollar on Monday's close, meeting market expectations, but quickly weakened as the market further tested the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's "\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  point", dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The first trades showed the real at BRR1.79/dlr on a spread of BRR1.78-1.80/dlr, but a few minutes later the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was trading at a mid rate of BRR1.85 on a spread of BRR1.84-1.86/dlr, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "It seems the market is pushing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to see where it will come in selling (dollars), no doubt" said a Sao Paulo \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader, who recalled the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's unconfirmed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday. \par \par \uc2  As reported, traders confirmed Friday that the Banco do Brasil - considered a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  "financial agent" - sold dollars in illiquid trade at around BRR1.75/dlr to ease the selling pressure on the real. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said banks' supply of dollars is "finished," so any extra liquidity in trading Tuesday will "almost definitely" come from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  On confirming the new free float exchange regime January 18, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  only to contain "brusque" movements in exchange rates. Traders consider this policy a "dirty float". \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Since the new policy was unvieled, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has made no\par official \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par -  By Jamie McGeever (5521) 580-9394; jmcgeever@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 26-01-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1201GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv1q00mmi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
