ght\uc2  also hit the real on Thursday, traders said. \par \par \uc2  ((Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5423)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv1m0650c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
