\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  real ends steady 1.72/dlr post- \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 265 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Januar 1999\par 21:46\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO, Jan 22 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's embattled real \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  closed Friday at 1.72 to the dollar, holding Thursday's closing price after the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the first time since letting it float freely, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The bank stepped in to sell dollars in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets through state-owned Banco do Brasil early Friday after it had tumbled 7.6 percent to an all-time low of 1.72 reais per dollar Thursday as dollar stocks started to get depleted. \par \par \uc2  "The Banco do Brasil appeared to have acted some five or six times in the market today. It went in, gave relief to the market and got out," one trader said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar shortages followed a wave of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  outflows that were averaging $300 million a day. Local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets lost a net $411 million Thursday, but outflows Friday were expected once all \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  were added up to be back down to $300 million, traders said. \par \par \uc2  As of 1725 local/1925 a net $112 million had flowed out of \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  probably stepped in Friday to replenish the depleted market rather than to defend the real at a particular level. \par \par \uc2  In the commercial \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market the real closed steady at 1.72 to the dollar. The real also held steady at 1.80 per dollar in the floating \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, but the real weakened 1.64 percent to 1.83 in the parallel market. \par \par \uc2  ((Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 55 11 507 4151)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv1m05ya8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
