\par\par \b \uc2  Malan/Greenspan-2: Malan Expected To Give Press Conference \b0\par\par\uc2 250 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Januar 1999\par 15:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO (Dow Jones)--Brazilian Finance Minister Pedro Malan will meet with U.S. Federal Reserve Board Chairman Alan Greenspan at 1600 GMT Monday at the headquarters of the International Monetary Fund, the Estado news agency reported. \par \par \uc2  Malan's chief of staff Joao Batista, who is accompanying the minister in Washington D.C. for a series of meetings, said Malan will likely give a news conference later in the day. \par \par \uc2  Malan spent the weekend in Washington for talks with the IMF, World Bank, Inter-American Development Bank and the U.S. Treasury Department following the Brazilian government's decision to allow its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real, to float freely against the dollar for one day. \par \par \uc2  Early Monday, Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced that the free-float policy had been formally adopted and that the government would only \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to contain brusque \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market movements. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2  agreed to terms last November with a group of international lenders led by the IMF for $41.5 billion in funding. \par \par \uc2  The accord between the IMF and Brazil specified that Brazil wouldn't alter its long-standing policy of gradual adjustments of the mini-band in which the real traded against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  President Fernando Henrique Cardoso said last Friday that the decision to allow a free-float was aimed at protecting the country's reserves, which had tumbled to below $30 billion, from over $70 billion last July. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 18-01-99 \par \par \uc2  1413GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv1i00ehs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
