\par\par \b \uc2  FULL TEXT-Brazil cenbank says lets  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  float. \b0\par\par\uc2 126 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Januar 1999\par 13:20\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO, Jan 18 (Reuters) - The following is the full text of Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  communique on Monday stating it would let market forces determine the value of the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "COMMUNIQUE NUMBER 006565 \par \par \uc2  To Authorised \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Institutions: \par \par \uc2  We Bring to Your Attention That: \par \par \uc2  I. Beginning today, Monday, 1/18/99, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Brazil will allow the interbank market(commercial and floating segments) to determine the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate. \par \par \uc2  II. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in markets, occasionally and in a limited fashion, with the purpose of limiting abrupt fluctuations in the exchange rate." \par \par \uc2  BRASILIA, JANUARY 18 1999 \par \par \uc2  DEMOSTHENES MADUREIRA DE PINHO NETO \par \par \uc2  DIRECTOR OF INTERNATIONAL AFFAIRS. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv1i06ef8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
