\par\par \b \uc2  Brady Bonds Skyrocketing On Puzzling Euphoria Over Brazil \b0\par\par\uc2 354 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Januar 1999\par 16:51\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  NEW YORK (Dow Jones)--After seven sessions of straight losses, Brady bonds are surging dramatically mid-morning Friday following Brazil's decision to let its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  float freely. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced earlier that it will not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Friday. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's C-bonds surged 5 11/16 to 54 7/16 bid, while EIs powered 7 7/8 higher to 60 3/8 bid. \par \par \uc2  As many participants were puzzled by such an euphoric market reaction, a massive short squeeze was taking place, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "This is an insanity, it's outrageous, it just can't last," a trader said. \par \par \uc2  With the bond market closing at 2:00 p.m. EST Friday and financial marketplaces closed Monday in observance of the Martin Luther King Jr. holiday, traders said they expect the emerging debt market to finish the session sharply higher but to take a colossal slump Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  "Brazil is in an absolute desperate situation," a trader said. "Unless there's a miracle, the market will slump again Tuesday," he warned. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the Brazilian shares were skyrocketing Friday morning following the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  statement, gaining more than 23%, at 10:45 a.m. EST (1545 GMT). \par \par \uc2  "It's just inexplicable," a dealer said. "I'm sure there must be a massive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  there." \par \par \uc2  Although to many Friday's buying spree could not be backed rationally, prices were speaking for themselves, as the euphoria spilled over into the rest of the region like wildfire. \par \par \uc2  Argentine FRBs jumped 3 3/8 to 78 3/8 bid. Global bonds maturing in 2027 soared 10 to 81 bid. \par \par \uc2  Mexican Pars climbed 2 1/2 to 73 1/2 bid, and the UMSs due in 2026 gained 6 1/2 to 100 3/4 bid. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The spread of the J.P. Morgan Emerging Markets Bond Index has\par tightened about 177 basis points to 1345 basis points over comparable\par U.S. Treasurys.\par -By Enza Tedesco; 201-9382203; enza.tedesco@cor.dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  15-01-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1551GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1179 1810 4071 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010827dv1f000n7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
