\par\par \b \uc2  Bradys -2: Real's News Ignites Fury Of Short Coverying \b0\par\par\uc2  By 9:15 EST, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's government confirmed that it would not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, and that it was revoking the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading band announced Wednesday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also announced that a communique concerning its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy would be made Monday. \par \uc2 308 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Januar 1999\par 15:07\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  The news ignited furious short covering in Brady bonds, as the market welcomed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decision to effectively allow the real to float freely - if only, perhaps, temporarily. \par \par \uc2  Traders had expressed deep pessimism that the government would be able to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at unsustainable levels. \par \par \uc2  "We are relieved that the guys aren't wasting money defending the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It will set a more positive tone in the market," a London-based trader said. He noted there was some healthy buying in Argentina from a major institution that he suspected was purchasing bonds on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Argentine FRBs surged 2 points to 75 bid, but the PARs are unchanged at 64 bid. \par \par \uc2  The exodus of reserves fleeing Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets swelled to $1.79 billion Thursday, the highest one-day figure of the year. The market saw $1.09 billion in capital flight Wednesday and $1.2 billion on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  But there is some dissension among participants that expanding the real's trading level is healthy for the market. "People are thinking this is very dangerous and (they) are acting out of pure emotion," another trader said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Meanwhile, the spread of the J.P. Morgan Emerging Markets Bond Index,\par or EMBI, has tightened about 145 basis point to 1377 basis points over\par U.S. comparable Treasurys.\par -By Angela Pruitt; 201-938-2269\par angela.pruitt@cor.dowjones.com  -(AP-DJ-01-15-99 1407GMT)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  15-01-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1407GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1179 1810 4071 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010827dv1f000mx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw200\pich25\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3000\pichgoal375
