\par\par \b \uc2  IMF/Brazil -2: Says Measures Will Save  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Reserves \b0\par\par\uc2 234 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Januar 1999\par 20:50\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WASHINGTON (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decision to pull back from further \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in support of the real Friday "appears to be a wise move" that will protect the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, the International Monetary Fund said Friday. \par \par \uc2  An IMF spokesperson said in a telephone interview the Brazilian government had contacted the fund before deciding to abandon its latest trading band for the real against the dollar, essentially allowing the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to float freely until a new exchange rate regime is unveiled next Monday. \par \par \uc2  "The fund's staff and management were in contact with the Brazilians prior to their decision to stop \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  today," the spokesperson said. "The decision to stop \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  appears to be a wise move to stop the loss of reserves." \par \par \uc2  The IMF spokesperson confirmed earlier reports that Pedro Malan and Francisco Lopes - respectively Brazil's finance minister and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president - will be meeting with fund management over the weekend in Washington. \par \par \uc2  But the IMF official rebuffed a report in the Financial Times of Britain that said the IMF would be sending a team of staff to Brazil to review the situation with the government. \par \par \uc2  "There are no plans for staff traveling to Brazil at the moment," the spokesperson said. \par \par \uc2  -By Damian Milverton, +202-862-9272; damian.milverton@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 15-01-99 \par \par \uc2  1950GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv1f00d8r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
