\par\par \b \uc2  Brazil float "wise move" to halt dollar flight-IMF. \b0\par\par\uc2 210 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Januar 1999\par 20:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WASHINGTON, Jan 15 (Reuters) - The International Monetary Fund backed Brazil's decision to float its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real, on Friday, describing it as a wise move which could stem the flood of dollars from the country. \par \par \uc2  "It appears to be a wise move to stop the loss of reserves," an IMF spokesman said. \par \par \uc2  The spokesman said the IMF had been informed in advance about \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decision to stop \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  A previous statement, issued when the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  widened the real's trading band in what amounted to the first stage of the country's two-stage devaluation, said only that Brazil had informed the IMF of the change and analysts said the fund was annoyed at the lack of consultation. \par \par \uc2  The spokesman confirmed that Brazilian Finance Minister Pedro Malan and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief Francisco Lopes would visit Washington for talks with IMF management this weekend. \par \par \uc2  "The next set of contacts between Brazil and the IMF will be in Washington and, for the time being, there are no plans for our staff to travel to Brazil," he said. \par \par \uc2  ((Washington newsroom, +1 202 898 8309, washington.economic.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv1f06g49\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
