\par\par \b \uc2  Brazil  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : Real Stable Vs Dlr; $1 Bln Outflow Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 275 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 September 1998\par 22:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO (Dow Jones)--While the dollar surged on the the black market, the Brazilian real (BRL) held steady against the dollar in the commercial market Thursday thanks to the dollar selling of the as the federally owned Banco do Brasil, traders said. \par \par \uc2  As has been habitual over the last month, the Banco do \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the real well within its crawling band despite the heavy outflows of capital. \par \par \uc2  "Up to now, we've seen a net dollar outflow of $1 billion, but it could end the day higher," said one chief \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at a Sao Paulo bank. He noted that the Banco do Brasil would have had to spend the same amount to hold the real steady. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, Brazilian shares fell by as much as 15% as stock markets fell heavily all over the world. But Brazil suffered more than most markets as perceptions grew that the government wasn't managing to keep capital from fleeing and that a devaluation might be on the cards. \par \par \uc2  On the commercial market, the dollar stayed all day at BRL1.1789 dollars on the buy side and BRL1.1790 on the sell side. On the black market, there were reports of a buy rate of BRL1.31 and a sell rate of BRL1.45. \par \par \uc2  "We haven't seen this much demand for dollars since the Real Plan began," said one black market money changer, referring to the economic stabilization plan begun in mid-1994. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 10-09-98 \par \par \uc2  2057GMT \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du9a07ten\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
