ng 500,000\par dollar-linked notes, known as NBC-Es, maturing April 17, 1999. The notes\par were sold at an average annual interest rate of 14.9%.\par    -By Geraldo Samor; 55-21-580-9394; gsamor@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  31-08-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2116GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010917du8v007zc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
