\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's real stabilizes on reported  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 209 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 August 1998\par 21:53\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO, Aug 27 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  real stabilised against the dollar after reported dollar selling by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  through a large state bank, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The real was trading at 1.1763 against the dollar, down 0.35 percent from its Wednesday close. The real weakened to as low as 1.1766 earlier in the session. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers speculated federal Banco do Brasil stepped in selling dollars on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent a further drop in the real. \par \par \uc2  Both banks would not comment on the speculation, but dealers have repeatedly spotted \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's indirect \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market amid recent global market turmoils. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  director Demosthenes Pinho Neto told Reuters Television: "We are monitoring the market very carefully," although he did not comment on the dollar sale. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said the weakening of the real today was due to an expected outflow of dollars from Brazilian markets. \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  players are predicting global investors are taking dollars out of the country to make up for losses posted in overseas markets," one dealer said. ((Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5423, noriko.yamaguchi@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021216du8r01o1v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
