\par\par \b \uc2  Brazil Well-Positioned -2: Govt's Ability To React Cited \b0\par\par\uc2 289 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 August 1998\par 21:41\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Analysts said that Brazil's markets have been particularly hard hit lately because they are highly liquid and fund managers that need to reduce positions worldwide find it easy to sell their Brazilian assets. \par \par \uc2  While analysts distinguish Brazil's financial situation from that of other emerging markets, they acknowledge that there's room for local markets to fall even further. \par \par \uc2  "The situation abroad is extremely complicated and I don't expect investor sentiment toward emerging markets to change soon," said Jose Carlos de Faria, senior economist at ING Barings in Sao Paulo. "Only when things calm down everywhere else will people take a look at Brazil again." \par \par \uc2  Confidence in the government's ability and willingness to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  when necessary is a key reason for optimism that \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2  will emerge unscathed from the turmoil. \par \par \uc2  "The government has proven that it knows how to handle monetary crises," said Faria. "\b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stability is obviously a top priority for the government." \par \par \uc2  Late last October, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  nearly doubled interest rates to protect the real from speculative attack amid financial turbulence in Asia. The government followed that up 10 days later with a broad fiscal package. \par \par \uc2  Government involvement in the most recent crisis has been limited, but sufficient to guarantee that Brazilian authorities will be proactive, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  Over the past two weeks, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers have detected state-run Banco do Brasil selling dollars on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , though the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  denies it. Also, stock traders said that the securities arm of the National Development Bank, known as BNDESPar, has snapped up shares at rock-bottom prices to support local exchanges. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 26-08-98 \par \par \uc2  1941GMT \par \par \uc2  1191 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8q07b33\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
