\par\par \b \uc2  Trading in Brazil shrs suspended due to nosedive. \b0\par\par\uc2 308 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 August 1998\par 18:29\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO, Aug 21 (Reuters) - Trading in Brazilian stocks were suspended for 30 minutes at 1235 local/1535 gmt Friday after global market fears sent local shares tumbling down 10.07 percent. \par \par \uc2  The Bovespa was down 10.07 percent to 7,187 points, hitting its lowest level since January 1997. \par \par \uc2  "Foreigners are selling what they still have left of Brazilian stocks," said one local trader. Global investors were cashing Brazilian equities to make up for the losses posted elsewhere, some brokers said. \par \par \uc2  Major concerns weighing on the Bovespa Friday included worries that Russia's economic troubles may affect Latin America as well as spreading rumours of an impending devaluation of the Venezuelan bolivar, brokers said. \par \par \uc2  Those jitters were reflected in Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, where the real was quoted down 0.09 percent at 1.1750 to the dollar by midday. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers estimated \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market via federal Banco do Brasil selling about $500 million in a bid to support the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The banks would not confirm the market speculation, but Banco do Brasil had been rumoured to have stepped in repeatedly amid unrest in global financial markets. \par \par \uc2  In the local bourse, top blue chip issue Telebras preferred  sank 7.66 percent to 92.80 reais before the circuit breaker was triggered. Other key shares sank to year lows. Petrobras  plunged 13.97 percent to 154 reais, while Eletrobras  lost 17.71 percent to 22.30 reais. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Brazilian debt was also battered, with the dollar-denominated C-bonds \tab      traded overseas down 4.5 percentage points at 55 bid and nearing their year low of 54.\par Its global bonds due 2001\tab \tab    lost a whopping 10.875 percentage points at 82.5 bid. ((Noriko Yamaguchi, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5423)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1998.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021216du8l01bdg\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (brazil near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brd